Summary:
Today’s work focused on implementing the backend functionality for handling portfolio evaluation requests. I created a dedicated evaluation route to process incoming profile analysis data. This route is designed to receive and manage user inputs efficiently for further processing. The setup ensures a structured flow for integrating evaluation logic in the next stages.

Outcomes:
Through this task, I gained practical experience in creating and organizing API routes in the backend. I developed a clearer understanding of how request handling works in Express.js applications. This implementation lays the groundwork for integrating analysis and scoring logic into the system. Overall, it improved my ability to design scalable and maintainable backend components.
